  <!-- ============ WHY ELECTRIC ============ -->
  <section class="sec light" id="why-electric">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head rv">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Switch</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Why Make the Switch to Electric?</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Electric mobility changes how a city feels — quieter streets, simpler running costs and smarter technology built into every ride.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-grid">
        <article class="why-card rv">
          <div class="why-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Lower Running Cost</h3>
          <p>Electric mobility can help reduce everyday running expenses compared to conventional fuel.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="why-card rv rv-d1">
          <div class="why-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 5 6 9H2v6h4l5 4V5z"/><path d="M15.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7"/><path d="M19 5a9 9 0 0 1 0 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Quiet Ride</h3>
          <p>Enjoy a smoother and quieter urban ride with no engine noise and instant torque.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="why-card rv rv-d2">
          <div class="why-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Cleaner Mobility</h3>
          <p>Electric scooters produce no tailpipe emissions while riding — cleaner air for your city.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="why-card rv rv-d3">
          <div class="why-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M9 9h6v6H9z"/><path d="M9 2v2M15 2v2M9 20v2M15 20v2M2 9h2M2 15h2M20 9h2M20 15h2"/></svg>
